Value Filldown local_asn (\d+)
Value Filldown router_id ([0-9a-fA-F:.]+)
Value Required peer_ip ([0-9a-fA-F:.]+)
Value peer_asn (\d+)
Value uptime (\S+)
Value state (\S+(?:\s+\(\w+\))?)
Value prefixes_received (\d+)

Start
  ^BGP\s+router\s+identifier\s+${router_id},\s+local\s+AS\s+number\s+${local_asn}
  ^Neighbor\s+V\s+AS\s+MsgRcvd\s+MsgSent.*$$ -> Peers

Peers
  ^\s*${peer_ip}\s+\d+\s+${peer_asn}\s+\d+\s+\d+\s+\d+\s+\d+\s+\d+\s+${uptime}\s+${prefixes_received}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*${peer_ip}\s+\d+\s+${peer_asn}\s+\d+\s+\d+\s+\d+\s+\d+\s+\d+\s+${uptime}\s+${state}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*$$ -> Start
